# DACore is not Bootstrap (LAW)

Canonical: `AIRULES/33-DACORE-PAGES-AND-UI.md` §0.

The DACore shell is **DotApp + DACore**, not a Bootstrap app. `core.css` may reuse class names (`btn`, `card`, `form-control`). That is **theme CSS**. Bootstrap JS is **not** loaded.

## MUST NOT

- `bootstrap.bundle.js` / extra Bootstrap CSS
- `data-bs-toggle="tab"` / `data-bs-target` / `.tab-pane.fade` as the tab switcher (clicks do nothing)
- Bootstrap `row` / `col-*` for new admin layout

## MUST

- Tab look = **real GET subpages** + `<a href>` + **this module’s** CSS
- Grid = `<dot-grid>` / `<dot-col>`
- Modals the shell already wires = `$dotapp().modal()` (`dotapp.modals.js`), not Bootstrap Tab
